    "not_checkable_because": "the layer tiles are 437 MB and are not committed in the producing repo either -- they are fetched from a host on both sides of the boundary. `git show <commit>:<path>` has nothing to show, so there is no upstream blob to compare against. What verifies these bytes is the digest in `files`, which is the whole of the check decision 948 rules and needs no checkout at all."
